<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" language="java" %>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Google Form Layout</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/landingPage.css">
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://code.jquery.com/ui/1.13.2/themes/base/jquery-ui.css">
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/ui/1.13.2/jquery-ui.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <div class="header-container">
        <img class="logo" alt="로고" src="/resources/img/common/logo.png">
    </div>
</header>

<div class="content-wrapper">
    <div class="main-content">
        <h1>FILL IN으로 유용한 <br>정보 빠르게 얻기</h1>
        <p>온라인 양식과 설문조사를 손쉽게 만들고 공유하며 실시간으로 <br>응답을 분석할 수 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="buttons">
            <a href="/member/register" class="solid-btn">가입하기</a>
            <a href="/member/login" class="outline-btn">로그인하기</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar">
        <div class="form-elements">
            <img src="/resources/img/common/landingPage.png" class="sidebar-image">
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
